 "id": "atomic_masses",
 "notes": [
  "Weights are intervals: CIAAW's interval, or the value plus/minus its standard uncertainty. Only ratios are used (mass fractions), so the molar mass constant cancels.",
  "Elements marked 'g' by CIAAW (e.g. Ca) can fall outside the range in exceptional geological samples; using the standard weight is an assumption."
 ],
